                            {
                                "example_id": "d9a85b0b-fe66-45d9-a253-19ffb92cf00b",
                                "sense_id": "a194b6b8-d3c3-3fdb-a7b8-3511848c2a06",
                                "text": "Пору́чик глубоко́ презира́л в душе́ гимнази́стов, у кото́рых, по его́ мне́нию, не́ было и не могло́ быть вое́нной вы́правки.",
                                "translation": "The lieutenant deep in his heart detested those students, who, in his opinion, had not and could never have a military bearing.",
                                "english": "The lieutenant deep in his heart detested those students, who, in his opinion, had not and could never have a military bearing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
